# <type>(<scope>): <emoji> <description>
#
# <optional body — explain the what and why, not the how>
#
# Verified-by: Pint <N> errors, PHPStan <N> errors, audit <N> advisories
# Refs: #<issue>
# Closes: #<issue>
# Co-authored-by: <name> <email>
# Signed-off-by: <name> <email>
#
# ── Types ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# feat      ✨  new feature
# fix       🐛  bug fix
# refactor  ♻️  refactor, no behavior change
# perf      ⚡️  performance improvement
# docs      📝  documentation
# style     💄  formatting, no logic change
# test      ✅  add/fix tests
# build     📦  dependencies, build config
# ci        👷  CI/CD pipelines
# chore     🔧  misc maintenance/config
# revert    ⏪  revert a commit
# security  🔒  security fix
#
# ── Rules ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# - description: always in English, even if drafted in another language
#   first — translate it before committing
# - description: imperative, lowercase, no trailing period, ≤ 72 chars
# - scope: lowercase module name (e.g. auth, billing, api)
# - body: optional, wrap at 72 chars
# - Verified-by: fill in all 3 counters even if 0
# - Refs: optional, links the ticket without closing it
# - Closes: optional, use instead of/alongside Refs to auto-close the
#   ticket on merge (GitHub/GitLab)
# - Co-authored-by / Signed-off-by: optional, delete if unused
